/* ===================== *
 *      Riftblade        *
 * ===================== */
@1101 = ~riftblade~
@1102 = ~Riftblade~
@1103 = ~Riftblade:

Riftblades are heavily armored warriors who bend space and dimensional energy to control the battlefield. With a twist of the blade, they cross impossible distances, pull creatures through the void, or exchange places in the blink of an eye.
Rather than relying on exceptional weapon damage or defensive magic, Riftblades excel through tactical mobility, enemy disruption, and battlefield control.

Advantages:
- 1st level: Gains the Rift Trick modal ability.

Rift Trick:
The Riftblade reaches through the seams of the world, turning distance into a weapon. A single rift can carry the warrior across the battlefield, draw a creature close, or trade one position for another.
The three maneuvers ignore the normal one-spell-or-ability-per-round restriction and share a 3-round cooldown.

Rift Step:
The Riftblade slips between moments, emerging at a chosen point up to 30 feet away.

Rift Pull:
The Riftblade tears open a rift beneath a creature and drags it through space to <PRO_HISHER> side. The target must be within 30 feet. Enemies may save vs. spell at a -2 penalty to resist being exchanged.

Rift Exchange:
The Riftblade and a creature within 30 feet vanish into a flash of dimensional energy, reappearing in each other's places. Enemies may save vs. spell at a -2 penalty to resist being exchanged.

- 3rd level: May use Rift Strike once per day, gaining one additional use every 6 levels thereafter.

Rift Strike:
The Riftblade draws dimensional energy along <PRO_HISHER> weapon, making each blow resonate through the planes. 
For 3 rounds, melee attacks by the Riftblade deal an additional 1d6 magic damage and slow hit targets by 25%.

- 8th level: Rift Strike bonus damage increased to 2d4.
- 10th level: The saving throw penalties of Rift Pull and Rift Exchange increase to -4.
- 12th level: May use the Distortion Field ability once per day, gaining an additional use at level 24.

Distortion Field:
The Riftblade tears open a dimensional disturbance at a selected location, distorting the flow of space within its area.
All enemies within the area of effect suffer a 50% movement-speed reduction.

- 13th level: Rift Strike bonus damage increased to 2d6.

- 15th level: Gains the Dimensional Anchor passive ability.

Dimensional Anchor:
The Riftblade binds <PRO_HIMHER> essence to the material plane, resisting forces that would tear <PRO_HIMHER> away. The Riftblade is permanently immune to involuntary teleportation and dimensional displacement, Maze, and Imprisonment.

- 18th level: Rift Trick cooldown reduced to 2 rounds.

- High-Level Abilities: May learn the Rift Rend and Eternal Rift high level abilities.

Rift Rend:
The Riftblade delivers a devastating melee strike with <PRO_HISHER> next successful melee attack. Struck target is trapped in a dimensional labyrinth for several rounds as per the Maze spell.
This effect bypasses weapon protection spells such as Protection From Magical Weapons (requires EEex).

Eternal Rift:
The Riftblade delivers a final strike with <PRO_HISHER> next successful melee attack. Struck target is permanetly trapped in an eternal prison beyond the boundaries of the material plane as per the Imprisonment spell.
This effect bypasses weapon protection spells such as Protection From Magical Weapons (requires EEex).

Disadvantages:
- d8 hit dice.
- May not learn the Whirlwind and Greater Whirlwind high level abilities.~

@1104 = ~Rift Trick~
@1105 = ~Rift Trick: 
The Riftblade reaches through the seams of the world, turning distance into a weapon. Choose one of three instant teleportation maneuvers:

Rift Step: Teleport to a selected location within 30 feet.
Rift Pull: Teleport a selected creature within 30 feet to your location.
Rift Exchange: Swap positions with a creature within 30 feet.

Enemies may save vs spell at a -2 penalty (-4 at level 10) to resist being teleported.
These maneuvers ignore the normal one-spell-or-ability-per-round restriction and share a 3-round cooldown (2 rounds from level 18 on).~

